# pressButton(Block block, Player player)
# Entry point wired to the slot-machine button. Ignores presses while a
# spin is already running for this player (the per-player `spinning` lock),
# otherwise kicks off the spin. The @delay loop inside spin yields the
# server tick each frame, so the world keeps running during the animation.
@using rygamb
@fast

@if spinning[player]
    @player &7The reels are still spinning...
    @return
@fi

@var spin(block, player)
